      "writtenOn": "2024-02-12T14:55:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are places where we start VMs where PackageManager isn\u0027t available - e.g. in CompOS on boot. This will deadlock, I think.\nSo we should avoid calling this in such cases - e.g. when uid \u003d 0 (root).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 289,
