      "writtenOn": "2024-02-12T17:37:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh that is a good point. VirtMgr also uses PackageMgr to get list of staged apexes. Aren\u0027t those required for Compos verification or the staged apexes are already installed?\nI\u0027ve added \"UNKNOWN\" for such cases.",
      "parentUuid": "f9a43d36_f79aee54",
